# AI context isolation

- Open `AI_ROUTER.md` first; pick ONE domain row; open only that `.mdc` + folder.
- Never load `PROJECT_INDEX.md` or full historic docs unless the human explicitly asks.
- Prefer `modules/`, `core/`, `infra/` over scanning all of `src/`.
- Keep App Router files in `src/app/**`; do not relocate routes.
- Old paths under `src/lib`, `src/utils/supabase`, `src/features/**` are thin re-export shims — edit the real file under `modules/` / `core/` / `infra/`.
- Ignore `archive/` and long human docs (listed in `.cursorignore`).
- Modules may import `core`/`infra`; `core` and `infra` must not import `modules`.
